/*!
	\mainpage NewGUI API Reference

	NewGUI is a cross-platform UI toolkit in C++23 whose architecture follows
	the Interface Kit of Haiku: one looper per window, messages, a persistent
	view tree, constraint layout and exchangeable looks.

	The project is in its early port phase; there is no stable API yet. The
	specification, the conventions and the test evidence are on the
	<a href="../">documentation site</a>.
*/


/*!
	\namespace ngui
	\brief All of NewGUI. Submodules are nested namespaces (ngui::gfx ...).
*/
